// A plan keeps each of twenty-four steps.
// One step still stops at 239 letters.
// A later done step still marks the earlier ones.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE plan ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG plan law

IMPULSE plan 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "plan" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
